        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Renáta Tomanová, Larisa Neiland, Billy Martin, Anne Smith, Stanislav Birner, Arantxa Sánchez Vicario\n- Places: Czechoslovakia, Soviet Union, Latvia\n- Events: 1980 French Open – Mixed Doubles, 1999 WTA Tour Championships – Doubles\n- Roles: professional tennis players\n\nFacts:\n- Renáta Tomanová, born on 9 December 1954, is a former professional tennis player from Czechoslovakia.\n- Larisa Neiland, born Larisa Savchenko on 21 July 1966, is a former professional tennis player who represented the Soviet Union and Latvia.\n- In the 1980 French Open mixed doubles final, Billy Martin and Anne Smith defeated Stanislav Birner and Renáta Tomanová to win the title.\n- In the 1999 WTA Tour Championships doubles event, Larisa Neiland and Arantxa Sánchez Vicario eliminated another team in the semifinals.",
